---

<Layout
	path="/id/"
	title="Kompas Online — Navigasi Geodesi, Waterpass & Speedometer GPS"
	description="Kompas digital online akurat gratis dengan utara sejati dan magnetik, deklinasi WMM, waterpass digital, speedometer GPS, dan pencari arah kiblat."
	keywords="kompas online, kompas digital gratis, utara sejati vs magnetik, deklinasi magnetik, waterpass online, speedometer gps online, hitung arah bearing, arah kiblat"
>
	<!-- ─── Hero Section ───────────────────────────────────── -->
	<section id="compass" class="relative overflow-hidden">
		<div class="mesh-gradient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 pt-12 pb-16 text-center sm:px-6 md:pt-20 md:pb-24">
			<Compass />
			<div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl md:mt-14">
				<div class="badge mx-auto">gratis · privat · tanpa instalasi</div>

				<h1 class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl text-[34px] leading-[40px] font-bold text-ink sm:text-display-xl md:text-[54px] md:leading-[60px]">
					Kompas yang menunjuk utara sejati, bukan hanya magnetik.
				</h1>

				<p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-body-lg text-body">
					Arah perangkat secara real time dengan deklinasi otomatis, koordinat GPS, arah Qibla, dan posisi matahari — semuanya di browser Anda. Tidak ada yang perlu diinstal, tidak ada yang diunggah.
				</p>

				<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
					<a href="#engineering" class="btn-primary">Arsitektur Sensor</a>
					<a href="/id/compass/" class="btn-secondary">Buka Kompas Layar Penuh</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ─── Feature Highlights Strip ───────────────────────── -->
	<section class="border-y border-hairline bg-canvas">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] grid-cols-1 gap-px overflow-hidden px-4 py-12 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:px-6">
			<div class="p-4">
				<p class="eyebrow mb-2">utara sejati vs magnetik</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-body leading-6">
					Deklinasi matematis dihitung otomatis dari World Magnetic Model (WMM) NOAA/BGS sehingga arah kompas Anda selalu cocok dengan peta di mana pun di Bumi.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-4">
				<p class="eyebrow mb-2">100% privasi di perangkat</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-body leading-6">
					Semua fusi sensor, kalibrasi magnetometer, dan perhitungan geodesi berlangsung langsung di mesin JavaScript ponsel Anda. Tanpa akun atau pelacakan server.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-4">
				<p class="eyebrow mb-2">aplikasi web siap pakai offline</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-body leading-6">
					Dapat dipasang langsung ke layar beranda ponsel lewat cache Service Worker. Kompas, waterpass, dan kalkulator tetap berfungsi di alam bebas tanpa sinyal seluler.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ─── Complete Navigation Toolkit Grid (All 8 Tools) ─── -->
	<section id="tools" class="scroll-mt-16">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28">
			<p class="eyebrow">rangkaian navigasi lengkap</p>
			<h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-display-lg text-ink">
				Delapan Utilitas Geodesi Presisi. Satu Platform Terpadu.
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-body-lg text-body">
				Setiap utilitas dirancang untuk eksekusi instan di peramban tanpa ketergantungan API luar, dengan latensi rendah dan akurasi algoritma standar profesional.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
				<!-- Tool 1: Digital Compass -->
				<a href="/id/compass/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
									<polygon points="12 4 15 12 12 20 9 12" fill="currentColor"></polygon>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">kompas</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Kompas Digital</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Dial responsif 360° dengan jarum halus, sudut derajat real-time, 16 arah mata angin, kompensasi kemiringan, dan tombol beralih ke utara sejati.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Buka kompas →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 2: Bubble Level / Inclinometer -->
				<a href="/id/level/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">waterpass</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Waterpass Digital</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Level mata sapi melingkar dan tabung silinder untuk mengukur pitch, roll, sudut gabungan, dan persentase kemiringan dengan kalibrasi nol relatif dan getar.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Buka waterpass →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 3: GPS Speedometer & Altimeter -->
				<a href="/id/speedometer/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"></path>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">kecepatan & alt</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Speedometer GPS</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Pelacakan kecepatan kinematik lewat Doppler satelit dengan pilihan satuan (km/h, mph, knot, m/s), elevasi elipsoid WGS84, dan odometer perjalanan.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Buka speedometer →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 4: Coordinate Converter & Bearing Calculator -->
				<a href="/id/bearing/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
									<polyline points="12 2 22 12 12 22"></polyline>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">navigasi</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Kalkulator Bearing</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Perhitungan azimut busur lingkaran besar, arah balik, dan jarak Haversine digabungkan dengan konversi koordinat Derajat Desimal, DMS, UTM, dan Plus Code.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Buka kalkulator →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 5: GPS Location & Telemetry -->
				<a href="/id/location/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
									<path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3"></path>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">lokasi</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Koordinat GPS</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Garis lintang, garis bujur geodesi akurasi tinggi, ketinggian di atas permukaan laut, dan radius akurasi dengan tombol salin cepat dan buka di peta.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Lihat koordinat →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 6: Direction to Makkah (Qibla) -->
				<a href="/id/qibla/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"></rect>
									<line x1="12" y1="4" x2="12" y2="20"></line>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">kiblat</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Arah Kiblat Makkah</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Azimut lingkaran besar menuju Ka'bah di Makkah dengan jarak geodesi dalam kilometer dan mil laut, disertai penunjuk visual sejajar pada dial kompas.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Cari arah kiblat →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 7: Solar Position & Sun Compass -->
				<a href="/id/sun/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"></circle>
									<line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
									<line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
									<line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"></line>
									<line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"></line>
									<line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line>
									<line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"></line>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">astronomi</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Posisi Matahari</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Azimut matahari langsung, sudut elevasi, waktu fajar/senja, dan tengah hari matahari untuk kebutuhan pencahayaan arsitektur, foto, dan panel surya.
